{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40121","label":"COIN RUSH SHOWDOWN · Part 1"},"label":"Bunny Girls Are the Best: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_s","next":"event_coinrushshowdown1_02_s","speakers":{"sin_b":"Sin","flora_b":"Flora","mana_b":"Mana","guilty_b":"Guilty"},"icons":{"sin_b":"si_c405_00_s","flora_b":"si_c411_01_s","mana_b":"si_c290_01_s","guilty_b":"si_c404_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_1","text":"To summarize what Sin told me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CoinRushMainHall_expo","bgArt":"coinrushmainhall_expo","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_breakaway","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_2","text":"The Big Three manufacturers' expo is being held at Coin Rush, where each company will showcase their latest technologies and vision.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_3","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_3","text":"As part of this event, each company will select a team of elite Nikkes to compete against one another.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_4","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_4","text":"The company represented by the competition's final winner will be crowned the overall winner of the Big Three manufacturers' expo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_5","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_5","text":"The winning company will officially receive support from the Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_6","text":"That company will also take center stage at the next expo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_7","text":"In other words, this is a corporate showdown to decide the best of the Big Three, disguised as an entertainment event.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["sin_b","guilty_b","flora_b","mana_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_8","text":"Nikkes participating in the competition are free to equip themselves with any gear that showcases their company's latest technology.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_9","text":"For Missilis, it's these bunny girl outfits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_10","text":"I'm fine with the bunny girl outfits, but... Wait, no, I mean...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_11","text":"I'm fine with showcasing the latest technology, but why bunny girls?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_12","text":"Apparently, all participating Nikkes must wear outfits that embody the spirit of entertainment. That was a mandatory rule.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_13","text":"Though I'm not exactly sure what's so entertaining about these outfits...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_14","text":"Oh, bunny girl outfits are definitely entertaining. I'll give you that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_15","text":"Gotta say, though, this is an interesting lineup.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_16","text":"For a corporate competition, I'd expect a little more...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_17","text":"Heh. You expected more elite Nikkes to compete?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_18","text":"Good question. Why did they put together a ragtag team of two criminals, a gardener, and a researcher?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_19","text":"That's not what I meant...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_20","text":"Allow me to explain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_21","text":"Syuen was determined to win this competition and spared no effort in preparing for it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_22","text":"Her plan A was to have Matis, Missilis's strongest squad, participate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_23","text":"However, they were unable to, as they had to continue their surface defense operations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_24","text":"Plan B was to have Electric Shock and Mighty Tools compete.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_25","text":"This plan also fell through, as both squads are holding key positions within the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_26","text":"Her plan B-2 was...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_27","text":"She really didn't want to resort to plan C, huh.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_28","text":"... to have the School Circle and Dazzling Pearl squads of the M.M.R. Vocational School participate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_29","text":"However, this plan was quickly abandoned because it would be inappropriate for student Nikkes to wear outfits that embody the entertainment spirit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_30","text":"That's probably for the best.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_31","text":"All other Nikkes are currently deployed on different dispatch missions and cannot operate as a team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_32","text":"In the end, Syuen was forced to resort to plan C,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_33","text":"and Real Kindness Squad was chosen to compete.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_34","text":"Woohoo!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_35","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_36","text":"I'm surprised you actually got permission.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_37","text":"We've been rehabilitated, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_38","text":"Besides, it's only right for us to help our CEO in a pinch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_39","text":"Liar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_40","text":"Aww, come on. Have a little more faith in your squadmate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_41","text":"Ten demerit points to Guilty for not trusting her squadmate!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_42","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_43","text":"What about Quency?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_44","text":"We couldn't get ahold of her. I'm guessing she's avoiding us on purpose.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_45","text":"Or maybe she's just preoccupied with something else at the moment...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_46","text":"O-ohhh... I can't imagine what she might be doing...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_47","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_48","text":"What about you, Flora?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_49","text":"She volunteered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_50","text":"I was hoping to establish a business relationship with Carnation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_51","text":"Carnation...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_52","text":"She means Mustang.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_53","text":"Coin Rush is always brimming with people, making it one of the busiest establishments in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_54","text":"If I could arrange a deal to supply them with my flowers on a regular basis...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_55","text":"the garden's standing would rise, and Lobelia wouldn't be able to push us around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_56","text":"My goal is to promote the beauty of my flowers through this competition and win Carnation over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_57","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_57","text":"That's pretty ambitious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_58","text":"I must prepare for the future if I'm to survive Lobelia's whims, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_59","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_60","text":"Then, why are you here of all people, Mana?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_61","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_62","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_62","text":"... Mana downs the can of beer in her hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_63","text":"*Sigh*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_64","text":"Although I primarily work as a researcher at M.M.R.,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_65","text":"I'm also in charge of the rehabilitation program at the Rehabilitation Center.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_66","text":"It was a direct order from Syuen. I had no choice but to comply.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_67","text":"Since Sin and Guilty are part of this newly formed Plan C squad,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_68","text":"I was assigned as both their supervisor and the one in charge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_69","text":"I've been warned that I'll be held responsible if either of them gets themselves into trouble.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_70","text":"Hey, we've been rehabilitated! Of course we're not going to cause any trouble.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_71","text":"Yeah. We don't do stuff like that anymore...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_72","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_72","text":"Mana takes another swig of beer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_73","text":"*Sigh*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_74","text":"I was forced into this position, and now I'm expected to take responsibility if anything goes wrong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_75","text":"Don't you think that's going a little too far? Huh, Commander?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_76","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_76","text":"*Gulp, gulp*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_77","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_77","text":"Mana... Maybe you should stop drinking...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_78","text":"I can't... *hic* I can't exactly quit my job, you know...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_79","text":"Besides, just look at what I'm being forced to wear...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_80","text":"The only way I can stay sane is by drinking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_81","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_81","text":"*Gulp, gulp*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_82","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_82","text":"... I think it's best to just leave her be for now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_83","text":"Anyway, that's how things are now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_84","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_84","text":"Okay, I get the gist of what's going on now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_85","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_85","text":"But what does all this have to do with you showing up in my room?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_86","text":"Hehe, who knows?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_87","text":"... Ah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_88","text":"Sin, I have to step out for a bit...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_89","text":"Oh, are they here already? Will you be able to handle this on your own?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_90","text":"Yeah... Don't worry...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_91","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_91","text":"...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_92","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_92","text":"Guilty trudges out of the room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_93","text":"We're hoping you'll become our commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_94","text":"You'll come up with a strategy, devise a scheme, and lead us to victory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_95","text":"With you on our side, I think our little motley Plan C squad might have a chance to win.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_96","text":"I would greatly appreciate your help as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_97","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_97","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_98","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_98","text":"What are you plotting, Sin?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_99","text":"Hmm? I already told you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_100","text":"I just want to help our CEO. She believed in our potential and waited for us to be rehabilitated rather than discarding us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_kneeldownfools","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_101","text":"Since we've been successfully rehabilitated, it's only fair that we do this for her, don't you think?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_102","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_102","text":"*Crash! Thud! Boom!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_103","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_103","text":"Suddenly, I hear a loud commotion outside my room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_104","text":"Ah, looks like it's begun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_105","text":"I figured a lot of Nikkes would come looking for you too, but there seem to be a lot more than I expected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_106","text":"At this rate, Guilty might not be able to stop them all on her own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_107","text":"Poor Guilty... She worked up the courage to volunteer as a meat shield just so she could compete alongside you, but you're refusing to budge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_108","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_108","text":"Tell me what you're really after.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_109","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_110","text":"You don't trust me, do you, Instructor?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_111","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_111","text":"You don't trust me, either. You simply find me interesting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_112","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_112","text":"*Crash! Bam! Boom!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_113","text":"Guilty's really fighting hard out there. I guess she really wants to compete by your side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_114","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_114","text":"You're changing the subject again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_01_e_115","text":"You believed in us and helped us through our rehabilitation, Instructor. We just want to prove to you that your faith in us wasn't misplaced, th